{"id":"n65116-1-10","stage":1,"title":"설명 · 说明","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65116-1-10-1","ko":"이 글을 쓰게 된 이유는 무엇인가요?","zh":"您写这篇文章的原因是什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"글을","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글을","audio":"/audio/998a3a85cc413d979eb5.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰게","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰게","audio":"/audio/c1ba4f04468ff9ded02d.mp3"}},{"text":"된","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"12","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된","audio":"/audio/1c4305152ccc1be2241e.mp3"}},{"text":"이유는","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유는","audio":"/audio/6a15e669aed8fb094a64.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇인가요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇인가요","audio":"/audio/0bcb1313525b46dd350a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f77a9ef73a929938","term":"글","zh":"文章","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3","entryId":"59226","definition":"将想法或事情等用文字表达出来。","pronunciation":["글"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发生的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]}],"audio":"/audio/551c220f590526fe92b4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65116-1-10-2","ko":"지금부터 이유에 대해 하나하나 설명을 해 드릴게요.","zh":"接下来我会逐一为您解释这些原因。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금부터","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금부터","audio":"/audio/d989126e798118698e8e.mp3"}},{"text":"이유에","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유에","audio":"/audio/ba4bafee7be8916bc6b2.mp3"}},{"text":"대해","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대해","audio":"/audio/00981e3841325ed60db4.mp3"}},{"text":"하나하나","meaning":"一一，一个个，一个一个","explanation":"하나하나：一一，一个个，一个一个","readings":[{"term":"하나하나","audio":"/audio/98c219818719698aec86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84280","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나하나","audio":"/audio/98c219818719698aec86.mp3"}},{"text":"설명을","meaning":"说明","explanation":"설명：说明；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설명","audio":"/audio/8c3f651d3083e63da644.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65116","senseId":"1","lemma":"설명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설명을","audio":"/audio/0bb3af878c1334cbce13.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"对得起，值，值当","explanation":"하다：对得起，值，值当；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"11","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发生的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","ter